# Deploy bundle me bhejne ki zarurat nahi
node_modules
.git
.env
.env.local
credentials.json
apps_script_proof_upload.gs

# DB dumps na jaayein — par migrations code ka hissa hain aur "New Client Copy"
# tab ko poora source chahiye hota hai (adhura source ho to wo generate hi nahi
# karta), isliye migrations/ aur scripts/ ab deploy me jaate hain.
# `**` zaroori hai — migrations data/migrations/postgres/ aur .../mysql/ me hain,
# yaani do level gehri. Iske bina deployed app par generator "source files
# missing" dekar mana kar deta hai, aur yehi file client ki copy me bhi jaati hai.
*.sql
!data/migrations/**/*.sql
